{"id":"0177d22a8495acfe","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-logic9-morleyization.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Morleyization","display":"df-zfc-logic9-morleyization — ZFC Logic9 Morleyization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-morleyization","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-morleyization"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-morleyization — ZFC Logic9 Morleyization","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-morleyization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-morleyization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-morleyization — ZFC Logic9 Morleyization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L^*,T,\\rho,R,R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ar}^*\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L^*,T,\\rho,R,R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ar}^*\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^*=\\langle R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}^*\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L^*=\\langle R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}^*\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9Morleyization}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9Morleyization}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}morleyization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9Morleyization}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L^*,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists R,R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ar}^*\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L^*=\\langle R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}^*\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L^*)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\rho(\\varphi)=\\rho(\\psi)\\to\\varphi=\\psi)\n\\land R^*=R\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\cap(R\\cup F\\cup C)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{ar}^*\\upharpoonright(R\\cup F)=\\operatorname{ar}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\iota\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,m,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall k,\\ell\\in m\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\to\\iota(k)&lt;\\iota(\\ell))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\{v_{\\iota(k)}:k\\in m\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{ar}^*(\\rho(\\varphi))=\\max\\{1,m\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land T=\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L^*):\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\iota\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,m,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall k,\\ell\\in m\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\to\\iota(k)&lt;\\iota(\\ell))\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\{v_{\\iota(k)}:k\\in m\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\theta=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall v_0\\;(\\rho(\\varphi)(v_0)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi),&amp;m=0,\\\\\n\\forall v_{\\iota(0)}\\cdots\\forall v_{\\iota(m-1)}\\;\n(\\rho(\\varphi)(v_{\\iota(0)},\\ldots,v_{\\iota(m-1)})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi),&amp;0&lt;m\n\\end{cases}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}morleyization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9Morleyization}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L^*,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\exists R,R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ar}^*\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L^*=\\langle R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}^*\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L^*)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\rho(\\varphi)=\\rho(\\psi)\\to\\varphi=\\psi)\n\\land R^*=R\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\cap(R\\cup F\\cup C)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{ar}^*\\upharpoonright(R\\cup F)=\\operatorname{ar}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\iota\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,m,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall k,\\ell\\in m\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\to\\iota(k)&lt;\\iota(\\ell))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\{v_{\\iota(k)}:k\\in m\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{ar}^*(\\rho(\\varphi))=\\max\\{1,m\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land T=\\Bigl\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L^*):\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\iota\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,m,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\forall k,\\ell\\in m\\;(k&lt;\\ell\\to\\iota(k)&lt;\\iota(\\ell))\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)=\\{v_{\\iota(k)}:k\\in m\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\theta=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall v_0\\;(\\rho(\\varphi)(v_0)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi),&amp;m=0,\\\\\n\\forall v_{\\iota(0)}\\cdots\\forall v_{\\iota(m-1)}\\;\n(\\rho(\\varphi)(v_{\\iota(0)},\\ldots,v_{\\iota(m-1)})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi),&amp;0&lt;m\n\\end{cases}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each original formula receives a distinct fresh relation symbol, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is exactly the set of universally closed defining biconditionals.</li>\n<li>The language convention requires positive relation arities. A sentence therefore receives a unary symbol forced to be constant across the nonempty universe by its universally closed defining axiom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L^*,T,\\rho,R,R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ar}^*\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^*=\\langle R^*,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}^*\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S